      "position": [
        -624,
        -192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lab result × environment correlation\n\n**Before:** a lab certificate arrives as a PDF and gets filed. When a batch underperforms, finding out why means an hour or more of pulling climate logs, irrigation data and lab results from separate systems, and the cause often stays a guess.\n\n**After:** each new lab result is joined to the climate history of the room it grew in, and the team gets a plain-English explanation and a recipe recommendation.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cc09ea49-38a0-4f65-b924-4fee15732e7b",
